			(property "Description" "Bidirectional I2C level shifter\n\nNot compatible with all available part number pinout schemes- DOUBLE CHECK!!!\n\nVariants PCA9306DC and PSOP-8 are EOL. If your part has VREF as pin 1 then this is your variant. VSSOP_8PIN is not EOL.\n\nhttps://cdn.sparkfun.com/datasheets/BreakoutBoards/PCA9306DC.pdf Datasheet\n\nSparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12649 SparkFun Inventor's Kit for RedBot (ROB-12649)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13166 SparkFun RedBot Basic Kit (ROB-13166)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11955 SparkFun Level Translator Breakout - PCA9306 (BOB-11955)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13770 SparkFun Block for Intel Edison - ADC (DEV-13770)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13044 SparkFun Block for Intel® Edison - Raspberry Pi B (DEV-13044)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12589 SparkFun RedBot Sensor - Accelerometer (SEN-12589)"
